      "created_at": "2012-09-29T08:32:32.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I asked this same thing during playtest. Yes, they're immune to damage from hero targets, it's one of the errata from the playtest forums.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Christopher\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/christopher/48/1851_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Christopher:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<div><b>Koga wrote:</b><blockquote>Unity in Rook City:<br>The environment targets that are immune to Heroes, should they be immune to hero targets or are unity's bots able to hurt them.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nDr. Tremata and Tony Taurus should be immune to damage from Unity's bots as well.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
