      "raw": "I asked this same thing during playtest. Yes, they&#39;re immune to damage from hero targets, it&#39;s one of the errata from the playtest forums.\n\n[quote=\"Christopher\"]\n\n<div class=\"bb-quote\"><b>Koga wrote:</b><blockquote class=\"bb-quote-body\">Unity in Rook City:<br />The environment targets that are immune to Heroes, should they be immune to hero targets or are unity&#39;s bots able to hurt them.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nDr. Tremata and Tony Taurus should be immune to damage from Unity&#39;s bots as well.\n\n[/quote]\n\n&nbsp;\n",
